      <guid>//localhost:1313/1912/08/10/1382/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=&#34;postcard-2014-20140613_17151797_0606&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; src=&#34;//localhost:1313/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/postcard-2014-20140613_17151797_06061.jpg&#34;&gt; &lt;img alt=&#34;postcard-2014-20140613_17152558_0607&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; src=&#34;//localhost:1313/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/postcard-2014-20140613_17152558_06071.jpg&#34;&gt;From: G.L.W., To: Bess Chandler&lt;br&gt;
Mailed From: Pennsylvania on August 10, 1912&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Miss Bess Chandler&lt;br&gt;
Pearl, Illinois&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Well if you don’t want to write, you need not. But it seems a year since I heard from you. Are you sick?&lt;br&gt;
Please don’t forget&lt;br&gt;
G.L.W.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
